{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53197","headline":"诗偈 二十二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"痴儿无智慧，自嫌阿爷丑。\n阿娘生得身，嫌娘无面首。\n抛却亲爷娘，外边逐色走。\n六亲相将作，寻常不开口。\n恒游十二月，月月饮欲酒。\n夜夜不曾醒，醉吐饲猪狗。\n如此恶男子，缘事不了手。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}